{"n":97,"name":"Al-Qadr","nameAr":"القدر","meaning":"The Power","ayahs":5,"place":"makkah","bismillah":true,"ayat":[{"n":1,"juz":30,"ar":"إِنَّآ أَنزَلْنَـٰهُ فِى لَيْلَةِ ٱلْقَدْرِ","en":"Indeed, We sent it [i.e., the Qur’ān] down during the Night of Decree.","w":[{"ar":"إِنَّآ","tr":"innā","en":"Indeed, We"},{"ar":"أَنزَلْنَـٰهُ","tr":"anzalnāhu","en":"revealed it","root":"نزل","lem":"أَنزَلَ"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"in"},{"ar":"لَيْلَةِ","tr":"laylati","en":"(the) Night","root":"ليل","lem":"لَيْلَة"},{"ar":"ٱلْقَدْرِ","tr":"l-qadri","en":"(of) Power","root":"قدر","lem":"قَدْر"}]},{"n":2,"juz":30,"ar":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا لَيْلَةُ ٱلْقَدْرِ","en":"And what can make you know what is the Night of Decree?","w":[{"ar":"وَمَآ","tr":"wamā","en":"And what"},{"ar":"أَدْرَىٰكَ","tr":"adrāka","en":"can make you know","root":"دري","lem":"أَدْرَى"},{"ar":"مَا","tr":"mā","en":"what"},{"ar":"لَيْلَةُ","tr":"laylatu","en":"(the) Night","root":"ليل","lem":"لَيْلَة"},{"ar":"ٱلْقَدْرِ","tr":"l-qadri","en":"(of) Power (is)","root":"قدر","lem":"قَدْر"}]},{"n":3,"juz":30,"ar":"لَيْلَةُ ٱلْقَدْرِ خَيْرٌ مِّنْ أَلْفِ شَهْرٍ","en":"The Night of Decree is better than a thousand months.","w":[{"ar":"لَيْلَةُ","tr":"laylatu","en":"(The) Night","root":"ليل","lem":"لَيْلَة"},{"ar":"ٱلْقَدْرِ","tr":"l-qadri","en":"(of) Power","root":"قدر","lem":"قَدْر"},{"ar":"خَيْرٌۭ","tr":"khayrun","en":"(is) better","root":"خير","lem":"خَيْر"},{"ar":"مِّنْ","tr":"min","en":"than"},{"ar":"أَلْفِ","tr":"alfi","en":"a thousand","root":"ألف","lem":"أَلْف"},{"ar":"شَهْرٍۢ","tr":"shahrin","en":"month(s)","root":"شهر","lem":"شَهْر"}]},{"n":4,"juz":30,"ar":"تَنَزَّلُ ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ وَٱلرُّوحُ فِيهَا بِإِذْنِ رَبِّهِم مِّن كُلِّ أَمْرٍ","en":"The angels and the Spirit [i.e., Gabriel] descend therein by permission of their Lord for every matter.","w":[{"ar":"تَنَزَّلُ","tr":"tanazzalu","en":"Descend","root":"نزل","lem":"تَنَزَّلَتْ"},{"ar":"ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","tr":"l-malāikatu","en":"the Angels","root":"ملك","lem":"مَلَك"},{"ar":"وَٱلرُّوحُ","tr":"wal-rūḥu","en":"and the Spirit","root":"روح","lem":"رُوح"},{"ar":"فِيهَا","tr":"fīhā","en":"therein"},{"ar":"بِإِذْنِ","tr":"bi-idh'ni","en":"by (the) permission","root":"أذن","lem":"إِذْن"},{"ar":"رَبِّهِم","tr":"rabbihim","en":"(of) their Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"مِّن","tr":"min","en":"for"},{"ar":"كُلِّ","tr":"kulli","en":"every","root":"كلل","lem":"كُلّ"},{"ar":"أَمْرٍۢ","tr":"amrin","en":"affair","root":"أمر","lem":"أَمْر"}]},{"n":5,"juz":30,"ar":"سَلَـٰمٌ هِىَ حَتَّىٰ مَطْلَعِ ٱلْفَجْرِ","en":"Peace it is until the emergence of dawn.","w":[{"ar":"سَلَـٰمٌ","tr":"salāmun","en":"Peace","root":"سلم","lem":"سَلام"},{"ar":"هِىَ","tr":"hiya","en":"it (is)"},{"ar":"حَتَّىٰ","tr":"ḥattā","en":"until"},{"ar":"مَطْلَعِ","tr":"maṭlaʿi","en":"(the) emergence","root":"طلع","lem":"مَطْلَع"},{"ar":"ٱلْفَجْرِ","tr":"l-fajri","en":"(of) the dawn","root":"فجر","lem":"فَجْر"}]}]}